Neutral NPC Engineer Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to NPC_Neutral_Engineer
    Actions
        Custom script:   local string a
        Custom script:   local string b
        Custom script:   local string c
        Custom script:   local string d
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Neutral_Engineer is in Companion_Group.) Equal to True
                InCinematic Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                -------- ======================= --------
                Custom script:   set a = "|cffffcc00"
                Custom script:   set b = GetHeroProperName(GetTriggerUnit())
                Custom script:   set c = "|r has |cffff0000died..|r"
                Custom script:   set d = a + b + c
                -------- ======================= --------
                Custom script:   call ShowSingleLineText(d, 0.5, 3, 1.5, 1.5)
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: (|cffffff00|r + ((Proper name of (Triggering unit)) + ( (|cff808080Engineer|r) +  |cffffffffhas|r |cffff0000died!|r)))
            Else - Actions
        -------- Start timer --------
        Countdown Timer - Start ReviveTimerEngineer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 60.00 seconds
        -------- Drop items --------
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
